    "text": "In the last crate that is opened, the captain finds a Boom Spider hiding. It uncurls its legs and attacks. Boom Spider  AV: 30 Def: 1 Dmg: -1 HP: 7 [K]: Scraps (25c) Abilities: Acid, Immobilise",
