    "text": "to replace the feature with its name (or zone number) found on the sector's Star Systems And Zones Sheet. 81 A smuggler with contacts to an organized crime syndicate is looking for someone to move some goods.. WEAPONS (SM): [NPC] wants you to collect 3d10+40 units (tons) of weapons from zone [ZONE #] in the [SYSTEM] system and drop off to zone [ZONE #] in the [SYSTEM] system (see operation for details). Expires: [DATE] (1 month). When you generate the star system where the weapons are to be dropped off, it must be in a different star system to the one where it is collected (re-roll if you generate the same star system). The captain can collect and deliver the weapons in any quantity they like. As it is delivered you can keep track of how much is left to transport by changing the mission's details (i.e. if you have 40 units remaining to transport, and drop off 25, you change the mission's details to say \"...Collect 15 units...\") As soon as the captain picks up the first load of weapons the captain gains +1 Law. When all weapons has been transported the mission is completed and the captain gains the reward. If you have begun the mission, but it expires before it is completed, someone in the crime syndicate has tipped off the authorities, see the Tracked Down event."
