    "text": "Stepping through a broken wall panel the captain is confronted by a crazed security officer. He opens fire and the captain has no choice but to fight back. Crazed Security  t AV: 40 Def: 1 Dmg: +1 HP: 10 [K]: A/K/W Abilities: AP, Fire, Swarm",
